  Synthesis reuse (no re-run of the 48 min CPU synthesis): the block
  synthesis results of the vivado_rnd runs (results/.../base) were
  copied over and checked against the branch:
    rtl/ + flow/designs/sky130hd/sigil_soc (53 files) identical on both
      hosts (sha256 of the sorted per-file sha256 list a910c098...)
    1_1_yosys_canonicalize.rtlil regenerated from the branch
      (do-yosys-canonicalize) is byte-identical to the one the
      synthesis used: CPU sha256 42c39e84..., crypto aa02031e...
